## Memory layers

| Layer | Location | Load when |
|:------|:---------|:----------|
| Knowledge notes | `memory/knowledge/<shelf>/` | an index line above matches the task |
| Facts | `memory/fact.yml` | user preferences / settings needed |
| Episodic | `memory/episodic.jsonl` | past decisions / failures needed |
| Associations | `memory/associations.jsonl` | exploring related memories |
| Brain regions | `memory/brain_region_manifest.yml` | routing a domain query |

## Commands

- `gish recall <query> --workspace .` — search episodic memory
- `gish knowledge new feedback <slug> -d "<one line>" --workspace .` — new note
- `gish knowledge lint --workspace .` — frontmatter, broken links, orphans
- `gish index budget --workspace .` — measure this file before adding to it
- `gish dream --workspace .` — nightly reorganize + archive (scheduled)
- `gish doctor --workspace .` — health check
